sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant S as FastAPI handler
  participant G as agent (built in lifespan)
  participant DB as Postgres

  C->>S: POST /chat {thread_id, text}
  S->>S: acquire per-thread lock
  S->>G: astream_events(version="v3")
  G->>DB: checkpoint per superstep

  loop tokens
    G-->>S: delta
    S-->>C: data: {"delta": "..."}
  end

  Note over C: client closes the tab
  C--xS: connection dropped
  S->>S: CancelledError in the generator

  alt policy: cancel
    S->>G: cancel the run
    Note over DB: checkpoint keeps work done so far
  else policy: finish in background
    S->>G: detach, let it complete
    Note over DB: full result is checkpointed<br/>and available on reconnect
  end

  S->>S: release the lock (in finally)
